OL,3,GNEWSAServices returning to fire-damaged
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FServices are starting to return to a
OL,7,Fmajor city hospital 10 months after
OL,8,Fpart of it was badly damaged by fire.
OL,10,FMore than 500 patients were evacuated
OL,11,Ffrom University Hospital Southampton
OL,12,Fwhen the blaze broke out early in the
OL,13,Fmorning of 1 February.
OL,15,FThe hospital's endoscopy unit was
OL,16,Fdestroyed, leading to major disruption
OL,17,Fto diagnostic services, and more than
OL,18,F60 inpatient beds are still out of
OL,19,Faction.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
