OL,3,GNEWSAServices returning to fire-damaged
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThroughout this year major work has
OL,7,Fgutted the wards, clinic rooms and
OL,8,Fcorridors affected by the blaze, which
OL,9,Fwas started by an electrical fault.
